  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic assistance for emergency in the Democratic Republic of Congo (SAFER)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme supports the outcome of delivering a coordinated humanitarian response by providing cash and voucher transfers, to meet the immediate needs of most vulnerable households faced by shocks, for example displacement due to conflict. SAFER will also deliver sustainable WASH infrastructure to IDP communities through installation of water pipes, tanks, water points and latrines.</narrative>
  </description>
